i trust you weren't praying foolishly ...

i believe that the strength lose for landmines times out when your
legs feel better (whereas a strength loss due to falling into a spiked
pit, for example, would be permanent).  in your agony, you might consider
invoking a strictly defensive posture and resting.  the way to get the
orc off your back is to successfully engrave `Elbereth', umm, using
your fingers, in this case ...

if you can ever manage to come by a unicorn horn, well, that might
help, also.

